lend%20mode='normal'%20in2='BackgroundImageFix'%20result='effect1_dropShadow_2639_17347'/%3e%3cfeBlend%20mode='normal'%20in='SourceGraphic'%20in2='effect1_dropShadow_2639_17347'%20result='shape'/%3e%3c/filter%3e%3c/defs%3e%3c/svg%3e\"></div><div class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-[#311777] uppercase mb-2\">For Humans</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#311777] mb-5\">Cognitive Financial Agents</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 w-[6px] h-[6px] bg-[#654CAD] mt-[0.6em]\"></span><span><span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Scenario-Native: </span>Specialized intelligence mapped to complex financial workflows.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-xs bg-[#654CAD] mt-[0.6em]\"></span><span><span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Decision-Grade: </span>Converting deep market synthesis into immediate execution.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 w-[6px] h-[6px] bg-[#654CAD] mt-[0.6em]\"></span><span><span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Compliance-Integrated: </span>Institutional grade trust embedded into every autonomous action.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"p-6 shadow-md rounded-lg border-black/5 border bg-white\"><div class=\"mb-3\"><img alt=\"For AI\" src=\"/assets/for-ai-CKg5hOne.svg\"></div><div class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-[#311777] uppercase mb-2\">For AI</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#311777] mb-5\">Autonomous Execution Infrastructure</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 w-[6px] h-[6px] bg-[#654CAD] mt-[0.6em]\"></span><span><span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Protocol-Agnostic: </span>Seamless integration via MCP, CLI, and specialized skill sets.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 w-[6px] h-[6px] bg-[#654CAD] mt-[0.6em]\"></span><span><span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Machine-Optimised Knowledge: </span>Financial know-how delivered in high-density, AI-native formats.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 w-[6px] h-[6px] bg-[#654CAD] mt-[0.6em]\"></span><span><span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">A2A-Ready: </span>The foundational interface for AI-to-AI discovery and settlement.</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 bg-[#F7F4FF] text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-360 mx-auto px-10\"><h2 class=\"text-[56px] font-extrabold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#6B4FBB] via-[#4A6FA5] to-[#2A9D8F] bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Modular, Seamless, Expandable</h2><p class=\"text-[#14043F] mb-16 mx-auto leading-relaxed text-2xl\">AgentX equips your AI with pre-built financial skills, enabling it to understand, assess,<br>and act across real financial environments.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#311777] mb-1\">Modular</h3><p class=\"text-[#222222] text-lg mb-8\">Use What You Need</p><div class=\"w-37.5 h-37.5 \"><img alt=\"Modular Icon\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width='150'%20height='150'%20viewBox='0%200%20150%20150'%20fill='none'%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3e%3cpath%20d='M7.03125%20125.156L37.5%20141.405V109.221L7.03125%2092.9695V125.156Z'%20fill='%2344288F'/%3e%3cpath%20d='M7.03125%2087.6539L37.5%20103.905V71.7211L7.03125%2055.4695V87.6539Z'%20fill='%236750A4'/%3e%3cpath%20d='M39.8438%2035.4703L9.66797%2051.5625L39.8438%2067.6547L70.0195%2051.5625L39.8438%2035.4703Z'%20fill='%23A695D7'/%3e%3cpath%20d='M140.332%2023.4375L110.156%207.34534L79.9805%2023.4375L110.156%2039.5297L140.332%2023.4375Z'%20fill='%2345D4CF'/%3e%3cpath%20d='M107.812%2043.5961L77.3438%2027.3445V51.5625V59.5313L107.812%2075.7805V43.5961Z'%20fill='%23369C9C'/%3e%3cpath%20d='M112.5%20141.405L142.969%20125.156V92.9695