e rounded-sm px-6 py-4 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"font-semibold text-[#311777] text-xl\">Act with Intelligence</div><div class=\"text-gray-500 text-lg\">Turn insights into real-world action</div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-sm px-6 py-4 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"font-semibold text-[#311777] text-xl\">Operate Across Systems</div><div class=\"text-gray-500 text-lg\">Effortlessly navigate both fiat and digital asset environments</div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/kyt-CrfRzV5I.png\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-28 bg-[#F7F4FF] text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-10\"><h2 class=\"text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#1a1a3e] leading-tight mb-8\">Start Building With <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-[#6B4FBB] to-[#2A9D8F] bg-clip-text text-transparent\">AgentX</span><br>and Bring Real Financial Capabilities<br>Into Your AI</h2><a href=\"/login\" class=\"px-7 py-3 bg-[#45D4CF] text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-teal-500 transition-colors text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2\">Register Now to Get Early Access to AgentX →</a></div></section><section class=\"max-w-360 mx-auto bg-white p-10 shadow-lg rounded-3xl mb-20\"><div class=\"max-w-360 mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"text-white\"><h2 class=\"font-helvetica font-bold text-[32px] leading-11.5 mb-3.5 bg-gradient-to-l from-[#399E9A] to-[#654CAD] bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Discover How MetaComp<br>Can Help You Unlock New Opportunities!</h2><a href=\"https://www.mce.sg/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mb-6 px-6 py-2 bg-[#3FB9B5] text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-teal-500 transition-colors text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2\">Learn More →</a><div class=\"space-y-4 text-[#222] text-lg leading-relaxed\"><p>At MetaComp, we believe in the transformative potential of the digital economy and are committed to bridging traditional finance with digital assets—empowering partners to navigate today's evolving financial landscape with confidence, security, and purpose.</p><p>Built on advanced technology and strong compliance, MetaComp delivers secure, seamless solutions for managing both fiat and digital assets. As a Major Payment Institution licensed by the Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS), we specialise in Digital Payment Token Services and cross-border payment transfers. At the core of our offering is the Client Asset Management Platform (CAMP), enabling secure, efficient, and scalable digital payments through both platform and API integration.</p><p>At MetaComp, we are not just shaping the future of digital finance—we are building the bridge to it.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><img alt=\"Coin\" src=\"/assets/future-B3Ky3F0a.png\"></div></div></section><footer class=\"bg-white pt-14 border-t border-black/5\"><div class=\"max-w-360 mx-auto px-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-10\"><div><img alt=\"MetaComp\" class=\"h-9 mb-5\" src=\"/assets/main-fc-CcNL9ptL.svg\"><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5\">160 Robinson Road #26-02, Capital Tower,<br>Singapore 068912</p><div class=\"flex gap-4\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/metacompsg/\" target=\"__blank\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" class=\"text-[#311777] hover:text-[#311777]/70 transition-colors\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"